{"title":"Alpine Fir Artificial Christmas Trees","description":"\u003ch3 class=\"collection-description__heading section-title h2\"\u003eBring the Outdoors In with Alpine Fir Artificial Christmas Trees\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003eBring the beauty of a natural evergreen into your home with the Alpine Fir artificial Christmas tree collection from King of Christmas. Inspired by the authentic structure and rich green tones of Alpine Fir trees found throughout Washington’s forests, this collection is handcrafted for exceptional realism and timeless holiday styling. Featuring softly layered branches, a graceful tapered silhouette, and detailed PE foliage, the Alpine Fir has become one of our best-selling artificial Christmas trees year after year.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003eAs the green counterpart to our beloved \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/collections\/queen-flock-artificial-christmas-tree\" title=\"Queen Flock Artificial Christmas Trees\"\u003eQueen Flock collection\u003c\/a\u003e, the Alpine Fir offers the same elevated craftsmanship and refined branch structure. Its balanced fullness creates a natural appearance that feels both sophisticated and effortlessly traditional, making it an ideal centerpiece for a wide range of holiday décor styles.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003eAvailable in both full and slim silhouettes, the Alpine Fir collection is designed to suit a variety of spaces, from spacious living rooms with tall ceilings to apartments, entryways, and narrower floor plans. Sizes range from 7.5 to 10 feet, allowing you to find the perfect fit for your home.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-section-id=\"y8avt6\" data-start=\"1223\" data-end=\"1260\"\u003eWhy choose the Alpine Fir?\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1262\" data-end=\"1641\"\u003eThe Alpine Fir is designed for those seeking a realistic artificial Christmas tree with a natural, mountain-inspired appearance. Its softly layered branches create depth and variation throughout the tree, closely mimicking the structure of a freshly cut evergreen. The rich green foliage and detailed branch tips provide a lifelike look that remains timeless season after season.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-section-id=\"gi7k2y\" data-start=\"1892\" data-end=\"1940\"\u003eShould I choose the slim or full Alpine Fir?\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1942\" data-end=\"2078\"\u003eThe Alpine Fir collection is available in both slim and full silhouettes to accommodate different room sizes and decorating preferences.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2080\" data-end=\"2289\"\u003eOur full Alpine Fir trees provide a more traditional Christmas tree shape with wider dimensions and additional branch space for ornaments, ribbon, and garland. These are ideal for larger rooms and open spaces.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2291\" data-end=\"2521\"\u003eThe slim Alpine Fir offers the same realistic foliage and elegant silhouette in a narrower profile, making it a great option for apartments, smaller living rooms, corners, entryways, or spaces where a full tree may feel oversized.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-section-id=\"yss33\" data-start=\"2523\" data-end=\"2583\"\u003eIs the Alpine Fir a realistic artificial Christmas tree?\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2585\" data-end=\"2966\"\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003eYes. The Alpine Fir is a part of our realistic artificial Christmas tree collection. Designed with high-quality PE foliage and carefully crafted branch variation, it replicates the texture, depth, and layered appearance of a natural evergreen tree. \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-section-id=\"1ehrjj9\" data-start=\"2968\" data-end=\"3025\"\u003eWhat decorating style works best with the Alpine Fir?\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"3027\" data-end=\"3280\"\u003eThe Alpine Fir pairs beautifully with a wide variety of decorating styles thanks to its classic green finish and natural silhouette. It complements traditional holiday décor, warm metallic accents, woodland-inspired themes, and minimalist styling alike.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"3282\" data-end=\"3472\"\u003eIts softly layered branches also create dimension that looks beautiful with ribbon, ornaments, and warm white lighting, while still maintaining an elegant appearance with lighter decorating.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-start=\"3282\" data-end=\"3472\"\u003eIs the Alpine Fir available pre-lit or unlit?\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"3282\" data-end=\"3472\"\u003eThe Alpine Fir collection is available in both pre-lit and unlit options to accommodate decorating preferences. \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"3282\" data-end=\"3472\"\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003eOur pre-lit Alpine Fir artificial Christmas trees feature professionally installed lighting designed to provide a warm and elegant glow throughout the tree. With Power Pole Technology, setup is seamless. No tangled cords, no complicated connections. Simply assemble, connect, and watch your tree light up instantly. \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-section-id=\"p78ym3\" data-start=\"3474\" data-end=\"3523\"\u003eIs the Alpine Fir easy to assemble and store?\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"3525\" data-end=\"3809\"\u003eYes. The Alpine Fir is designed for easy setup, convenient storage, and long-term durability. Its hinged branch construction allows the branches to naturally fall into place during assembly, making the setup time quick and easy while creating a full and realistic appearance with minimal effort.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"3811\" data-end=\"4096\"\u003eEach tree includes a sturdy stand along with complimentary setup gloves to help shape and fluff the branches comfortably during assembly. A complimentary storage bag is also included for convenient after-season storage and protection.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"4098\" data-end=\"4285\"\u003eWhen the holiday season is over, the tree can be easily disassembled and stored in a cool, dry place to help preserve its shape, foliage, and overall condition for years of continued use.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c!----\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"10-foot-alpine-fir-slim-tree-unlit","title":"10' Alpine Fir Slim Artificial Christmas Tree Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003eHandcrafted for lifelike realism, each branch mirrors the natural growth, color, and texture of a real Alpine Fir, native to the Washington state region. Enjoy festive charm without watering or needle cleanup, and bring the magic of a mountain-inspired Christmas into your home with ease.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"10' \/ Slim \/ Unlit","offer_id":40438533488840,"sku":"AFG-ST-10-U","price":599.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/Alpinefirslim.jpg?v=1722887007"},{"product_id":"12-foot-alpine-fir-slim-tree-unlit","title":"12' Alpine Fir Slim Artificial Christmas Tree Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003eHandcrafted for lifelike realism, each branch mirrors the natural growth, color, and texture of a real Alpine Fir, native to the Washington state region. Enjoy festive charm without watering or needle cleanup, and bring the magic of a mountain-inspired Christmas into your home with ease.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"12' \/ Slim \/ Unlit","offer_id":40438550823112,"sku":"AFG-ST-12-U","price":799.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/Alpinefirslim_be1c459a-73bf-4191-81a7-3cf2a425e6c7.jpg?v=1722887051"},{"product_id":"7-5-foot-alpine-fir-slim-tree-led","title":"7.5' Alpine Fir Slim Artificial Christmas Tree 650 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eHandcrafted for lifelike realism, each branch mirrors the natural growth, color, and texture of a real Alpine Fir, native to the Washington state region. Enjoy festive charm without watering or needle cleanup, and bring the magic of a mountain-inspired Christmas into your home with ease.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"7.5' \/ Slim \/ LED","offer_id":41323765891272,"sku":"AFG-ST-7-5-L","price":599.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/AlpineFirSlimLED_5b262354-10c5-400b-b1ed-f9abe46fc9b7.jpg?v=1723213462"},{"product_id":"9-foot-alpine-fir-slim-tree-led","title":"9' Alpine Fir Slim Artificial Christmas Tree 900 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eHandcrafted for lifelike realism, each branch mirrors the natural growth, color, and texture of a real Alpine Fir, native to the Washington state region. Enjoy festive charm without watering or needle cleanup, and bring the magic of a mountain-inspired Christmas into your home with ease.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"9' \/ Slim \/ LED","offer_id":41323776606408,"sku":"AFG-ST-9-L","price":799.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/AlpineFirSlimLED_f9acf269-0193-4420-90ab-d7079a6f9008.jpg?v=1723214101"},{"product_id":"10-foot-alpine-fir-slim-tree-led","title":"10' Alpine Fir Slim Artificial Christmas Tree 1000 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eHandcrafted for lifelike realism, each branch mirrors the natural growth, color, and texture of a real Alpine Fir, native to the Washington state region. Enjoy festive charm without watering or needle cleanup, and bring the magic of a mountain-inspired Christmas into your home with ease.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"10' \/ Slim \/ LED","offer_id":41323779424456,"sku":"AFG-ST-10-L","price":1149.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8